<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Gallery on Tao04</title><link>https://Tao04-hub.github.io/Tao04-hugo-dev/tags/gallery/</link><description>Recent content in Gallery on Tao04</description><generator>Hugo -- gohugo.io</generator><language>zh</language><lastBuildDate>Mon, 26 Jan 2026 00:00:00 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://Tao04-hub.github.io/Tao04-hugo-dev/tags/gallery/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>相册</title><link>https://Tao04-hub.github.io/Tao04-hugo-dev/p/image-gallery/</link><pubDate>Mon, 26 Jan 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://Tao04-hub.github.io/Tao04-hugo-dev/p/image-gallery/</guid><description>&lt;img src="https://Tao04-hub.github.io/Tao04-hugo-dev/" alt="Featured image of post 相册" /&gt;&lt;p&gt;Stack 主题内置了对相册的支持。你只需要简单地将多张图片并排放置，就可以创建一个精美的相册。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id="示例相册"&gt;示例相册
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://Tao04-hub.github.io/Tao04-hugo-dev/p/image-gallery/florian-klauer-nptLmg6jqDo-unsplash.jpg"
	width="667"
	height="1000"
	loading="lazy"
	
		alt="Photo by Florian Klauer on Unsplash"
	
 
	
		class="gallery-image" 
		data-flex-grow="66"
		data-flex-basis="160px"
	
&gt; &lt;img src="https://Tao04-hub.github.io/Tao04-hugo-dev/p/image-gallery/luca-bravo-alS7ewQ41M8-unsplash.jpg"
	width="1000"
	height="667"
	loading="lazy"
	
		alt="Photo by Luca Bravo on Unsplash"
	
 
	
		class="gallery-image" 
		data-flex-grow="149"
		data-flex-basis="359px"
	
&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://Tao04-hub.github.io/Tao04-hugo-dev/p/image-gallery/helena-hertz-wWZzXlDpMog-unsplash.jpg"
	width="1000"
	height="750"
	loading="lazy"
	
		alt="Photo by Helena Hertz on Unsplash"
	
 
	
		class="gallery-image" 
		data-flex-grow="133"
		data-flex-basis="320px"
	
&gt; &lt;img src="https://Tao04-hub.github.io/Tao04-hugo-dev/p/image-gallery/hudai-gayiran-3Od_VKcDEAA-unsplash.jpg"
	width="667"
	height="1000"
	loading="lazy"
	
		alt="Photo by Hudai Gayiran on Unsplash"
	
 
	
		class="gallery-image" 
		data-flex-grow="66"
		data-flex-basis="160px"
	
&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id="它是如何工作的"&gt;它是如何工作的
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;相册由 &lt;strong&gt;Photoswipe&lt;/strong&gt; 和一个自定义的内部脚本驱动。它会根据图片的宽高比自动计算出最佳布局。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;要创建一个相册，你只需要将多张图片放在同一行（或同一个段落）中。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 id="语法"&gt;语法
&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;"&gt;&lt;code class="language-markdown" data-lang="markdown"&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;![&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;图片 1&lt;/span&gt;](&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;image1.jpg&lt;/span&gt;) ![&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;图片 2&lt;/span&gt;](&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;image2.jpg&lt;/span&gt;) 
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;![&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;图片 3&lt;/span&gt;](&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;image3.jpg&lt;/span&gt;) ![&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;图片 4&lt;/span&gt;](&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;image4.jpg&lt;/span&gt;)
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
 &lt;blockquote&gt;
 &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;注意&lt;/strong&gt;: 图片之间应该有两个空格，以确保它们在 Markdown 中保持在同一行。&lt;/p&gt;

 &lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
